Package: blueroute-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: BlueRoute maintainers <ekkus93@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: blueroute (= @VERSION@), @SHLIBS@
Description: Desktop app for BlueRoute Bluetooth networks
 A graphical app for the BlueRoute daemon: shows network status in plain
 language, creates and leaves networks, reconnects a joined computer,
 renames this computer and helps diagnose problems. Every change is
 authorized by the daemon through PolicyKit.
